# The mutation gate digests `mutations/manifest.json` and trybuild compares
# `tests/probes/*.stderr` textually. Both are only evidence on the machine that
# wrote them unless the checkout is pinned: this repository runs with
# `core.autocrlf=true` and no repository-root `.gitattributes`, so a fresh
# worktree would otherwise receive CRLF and change every byte the gates read.
#
# Declared at the crate root rather than inside either directory, because the
# gates enumerate those directories and an unlisted extra file there is itself
# a failure.
mutations/** text eol=lf
tests/probes/** text eol=lf
